---
layout: base.njk
title: "DUE — Essays"
description: "See what is shipping now, browse recent essays, and jump into the next deadline."
---
{% set drafts = collections.draftEssays %}
{% set published = collections.publishedEssays %}
{% set latest = published | first %}

<section class="hero card spotlight">
  <div class="hero__copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Deadline for Unfinished Essays</p>
    <h2>Publish under pressure.</h2>
    <p class="lede">One topic. Thirty days. Essays go live finished or not. Minor contributions are acknowledged; major ones earn coauthorship. Every release is versioned and openly iterated.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/issues/new?template=new-essay.yml">Start a new essay</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/issues/new?template=suggest-change.yml">Suggest a change</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/essays/' | url }}">Browse essays</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__panel">
    <div class="stat-grid">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat__number">{{ published.length }}</div>
        <div class="stat__label">Published</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat__number">{{ drafts.length }}</div>
        <div class="stat__label">In progress</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat__number">30</div>
        <div class="stat__label">days to ship</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="caption">Essay length badges are color-coded: magenta for <500 words, orange for 500-1000, teal for 1000-1500.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="grid grid-two">
  <article class="card in-progress">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Now writing</p>
      <h3>In progress</h3>
      <p>Deadlines arrive fast—help keep the current draft on track.</p>
    </div>
    {% if drafts.length %}
      {% set active = drafts[0] %}
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="meta">
          {% if active.data.word_range %}<span class="badge {{ active.data.word_range | wordRangeTone }}">{{ active.data.word_range }} words</span>{% endif %}
          {% if active.data.started_at %}<span>Started {{ active.data.started_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if active.data.deadline_at %}<span>Publishes {{ active.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <h4 class="card-title">{{ active.data.title }}</h4>
        {% if active.data.topic %}<p class="muted"><strong>Topic:</strong> {{ active.data.topic }}</p>{% endif %}
        <p class="countdown"><span data-countdown>{% if active.data.deadline_at %}Publishes at {{ active.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}{% else %}Deadline not yet scheduled.{% endif %}</span></p>
      </div>
      {% if drafts.length > 1 %}
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="stack">
          <p class="eyebrow">Also drafting</p>
          <ul class="draft-list">
            {% for draft in drafts %}
              {% if not loop.first %}
              <li>
                <span class="draft-title">{{ draft.data.title }}</span>
                {% if draft.data.deadline_at %}<span class="muted"> — publishes {{ draft.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
              </li>
              {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <p>No drafts in progress. Start a new essay to begin writing.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Latest release</p>
      <h3>Most recently published</h3>
      <p>Catch up on what just shipped before the next round of edits.</p>
    </div>
    {% if latest %}
      <div class="stack">
        <h4 class="card-title"><a href="{{ latest.url | url }}">{{ latest.data.title }}</a></h4>
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="badge badge--tone-info">v{{ latest.data.version }}</span>
          {% if latest.data.word_range %}<span class="badge {{ latest.data.word_range | wordRangeTone }}">{{ latest.data.word_range }} words</span>{% endif %}
          {% if latest.data.initial_status == "complete" %}
            <span class="badge badge--tone-success">Published completed</span>
          {% else %}
            <span class="badge badge--tone-warn">Published unfinished</span>
          {% endif %}
          {% if latest.data.published_at %}<span>Published {{ latest.data.published_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if latest.data.release_notes and latest.data.release_notes.length %}
          <p class="muted"><strong>Latest:</strong> {{ latest.data.release_notes[0] }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p>No essays published yet.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </article>
</section>

<section class="card">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Explore</p>
    <h3>Keep reading and contributing</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Library</p>
      <h4 class="card-title">Browse all essays</h4>
      <p class="muted">See everything that has shipped and what is still cooking, all in one place.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href="{{ '/essays/' | url }}">Open the library →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Deadlines</p>
      <h4 class="card-title">Draft schedule</h4>
      <p class="muted">View every draft ordered by publish date so you can jump in where help is needed.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href="{{ '/drafts/' | url }}">See the queue →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Backstory</p>
      <h4 class="card-title">About DUE</h4>
      <p class="muted">Learn how deadlines, acknowledgments, and versioning shape the project.</p>
      <a class="inline-link" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">Read the story →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
